GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
TESSERACT_CMD=/usr/bin/tesseract
UPLOAD_DIR=uploads
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=<YOUR_PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY>
PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=<YOUR_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY>


Option A: Registration Required (Current - Recommended): Users register for free once → get an API key → pass X-API-Key: qg_live_... in requests.
Option B: Open Public Access (No Registration Needed): Anyone can call /api/generate immediately without any API key. (Note: Higher risk of API key abuse).
Option C: Hybrid Demo Mode: Allow non-registered guests 5 free tries per day (tracked by IP address). To get more, they must register for a free API key.